WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.968
♪♪

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.601
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:09.234
Tomorrow is Election Day,
which means President Biden's

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:12.234
impeachment trial, I guess,
starts on Wednesday.

00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:14.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:16.234
Former President Trump
is reportedly planning

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.567
to formally announce
his presidential campaign

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:19.834
on November 14th.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:22.334
No word yet on his choice
for V.P.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.033
or First Lady.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.100
Former President Barack Obama
and Donald Trump

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.801
held separate rallies over
the weekend in Pennsylvania.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.701
Obama campaigned
for John Fetterman,

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:35.934
and Trump campaigned
for 2024.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.667
Democratic Congressional
Campaign Committee Chair

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:42.200
Sean Patrick Maloney said
in an interview yesterday

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.601
that Democrats will maintain
control of Congress and added,

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:47.834
"We're not perfect,
but we are responsible adults

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:49.367
who didn't attack the Capitol."

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:52.167
Not exactly a high bar.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:56.300
Democrats are like the stepdad
of political parties.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.634
They may be lame,
but at least they're not the guy

00:00:58.634 --> 00:00:59.901
who walked out on you.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:03.734
"Hey, I'm here!"

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:06.033
Yesterday was the end of
daylight savings time,

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.434
in case you were wondering
why these all feel

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:11.300
more like 1:30 in the morning
jokes.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.100
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.868
The New York City marathon
was held yesterday,

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:19.267
and Kenyan runner Evans Chebet
was the men's champion

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:25.567
with a time of 2 hours,
8 minutes, and 41 seconds.

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:27.801
2 hours, 8 minutes,
and 41 seconds --

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:31.000
the fastest anyone has ever
gotten from Staten Island

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.367
to Central Park.

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:35.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.434
At a rally in Pennsylvania
over the weekend,

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:39.534
former president Trump
called Florida governor

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:43.200
Ron DeSantis, quote,
"Ron DeSanctimonious."

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.634
Has anyone ever been worse at
coming up with nicknames?

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:49.133
Imagine Trump in "Top Gun."

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:50.901
People, people,
I know we all love Maverick,

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.467
but I think I got one
that beats it.

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:54.534
Are you ready?
Everybody ready?

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:57.834
"Airplane Guy."

00:01:57.834 --> 00:01:59.467
That's right,
former President Trump

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.334
referred to Florida governor
Ron DeSantis

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:04.133
as Ron DeSanctimonious,
which is a risky move for Trump

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.000
because that's six syllables.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.701
A J.C. Penney location in
Pennsylvania temporarily closed

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:14.300
last week after a deer wandered
into the store.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.901
Even crazier, a couple weeks
ago, a shopper wandered in.

00:02:17.901 --> 00:02:20.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:27.834
He's asking what aisle
stuff's in.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.267
Over 50 students in El Paso,
Texas,

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:31.868
may have to retake the S.A.T.

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:34.534
after their answer sheets
flew out of a UPS truck

00:02:34.534 --> 00:02:36.934
and were either lost
or destroyed.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.300
The students are calling
the incident disheartening,

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.200
regrettable, disconcerting,
or irksome.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:46.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:48.467
Astronomers predict that
a total lunar eclipse

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:49.734
will occur tomorrow.

00:02:49.734 --> 00:02:51.734
So, if you look outside
and the moon turns red,

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:55.334
Don't worry, it just means
Dr. Oz won his Senate race.

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:58.968
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:01.300
That's what the prophecy
foretold.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.834
And finally, the makers of
Miller Lite this week

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:09.133
will offer a Christmas tree
keg stand.

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:11.133
And if you're wondering
what Santa's bringing you --

00:03:11.133 --> 00:03:12.701
AA pamphlets.

00:03:12.701 --> 00:03:14.234
♪♪

00:03:14.234 --> 00:03:16.534
Yesterday was Election Day

00:03:16.534 --> 00:03:17.934
and "Late Night"
is now projecting

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:20.601
the Democrats will pick up
at least one seat

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:21.834
at Thanksgiving dinner.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.801
In an interview last night
with NBC News,

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:27.667
South Carolina
Senator Lindsey Graham said,

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.467
"Hats off to the Democrats

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.267
for performing well
in swing districts."

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:33.901
Oh, yeah, hats way off!

00:03:33.901 --> 00:03:35.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.601 --> 00:03:37.634
Democratic Senator
Raphael Warnock

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.868
and Republican challenger
Herschel Walker

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:42.300
are set to head to a runoff
on December 6th

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.334
to decide Georgia's Senate race.

00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:47.767
And, if you think Georgia's
election process is confusing,

00:03:47.767 --> 00:03:51.367
imagine trying to explain it
to Herschel Walker.

00:03:51.367 --> 00:03:53.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.267 --> 00:03:55.501
Pennsylvania Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:58.367
defeated Republican candidate
Dr. Mehmet Oz yesterday...

00:03:58.367 --> 00:03:59.801
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:03:59.801 --> 00:04:01.334
...in the state Senate race.

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:04.267
Oz says he's just happy
he doesn't have to pretend

00:04:04.267 --> 00:04:06.400
to root for the
Philadelphia Steelers anymore.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:11.968
Democrat Maxwell Frost yesterday
became the first member

00:04:11.968 --> 00:04:14.667
of Generation Z elected
to Congress,

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:16.901
while Chuck Grassley recorded
another win

00:04:16.901 --> 00:04:19.300
for Generation Zzz!

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:21.400
[ Mumbling ]

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.901 --> 00:04:25.534
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
was booed this week at the

00:04:25.534 --> 00:04:28.367
Houston Astros World Series
Championship Parade.

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:30.434
As well as the bank,
the grocery store,

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:31.334
[ Laughter ]
his office,

00:04:31.334 --> 00:04:32.968
[ Applause ]
and at his house.

00:04:32.968 --> 00:04:35.968
All in all, a pretty average
week for Ted Cruz.

00:04:35.968 --> 00:04:38.000
[ Laughter and applause ]
President Biden

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.534
and former
President Barack Obama

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:41.400
posted a video
on Twitter this week

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.734
[ Laughter ]
reminding people to vote.

00:04:42.734 --> 00:04:45.434
You know, it's nice to see
they're still friends.

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:48.601
The only way we're getting video
of Trump and Pence together is

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:50.467
if Maury springs it on them.

00:04:50.467 --> 00:04:53.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:55.934 --> 00:04:58.133
Maryland yesterday became
the 20th state

00:04:58.133 --> 00:04:59.300
to legalize marijuana,

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.067
which means that,
for the first time ever,

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.868
there's something to do
in Maryland.

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:04.868
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:05:04.868 --> 00:05:08.133
Former President Trump voted
in yesterday's midterm elections

00:05:08.133 --> 00:05:10.267
in Florida, then,
because he can't help himself,

00:05:10.267 --> 00:05:12.868
took a bunch of ballots back
to Mar-A-Lago.

00:05:12.868 --> 00:05:14.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:16.133
And, finally, a Brooklyn man

00:05:16.133 --> 00:05:18.033
who was on the run
from fraud charges

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:19.701
was arrested recently in Florida

00:05:19.701 --> 00:05:22.901
after the federal agent
who signed his arrest warrant

00:05:22.901 --> 00:05:25.901
spotted him
at a Disney theme park.

00:05:25.901 --> 00:05:27.033
[ Laughter ]
Huh!

00:05:27.033 --> 00:05:28.300
It's a small world.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:36.767
Always...end...with....
a dad joke.

00:05:36.767 --> 00:05:38.267
♪♪

00:05:38.267 --> 00:05:40.234
President Biden spoke today at

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:42.968
a DNC event to thank staffers
and volunteers.

00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:45.501
Okay, but you know
who you really

00:05:45.501 --> 00:05:47.000
need to be thanking, right?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.334
I mean, the way his endorsements
performed,

00:05:49.334 --> 00:05:53.834
this man needs a fruit basket,
which would be a solid burn,

00:05:53.834 --> 00:05:56.400
because he doesn't eat fruit.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.868 --> 00:06:00.200
Following Democrats'
surprisingly strong performance

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.834
in the midterms, White House
chief of staff Ron Klain

00:06:02.834 --> 00:06:05.801
tweeted yesterday,
"Never underestimate how much

00:06:05.801 --> 00:06:07.534
Team Biden is underestimated."

00:06:07.534 --> 00:06:10.534
[ Laughter ]
And wow, what a rallying cry.

00:06:10.534 --> 00:06:11.767
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.200
That's like if Coach Taylor
said, "Clear eyes,

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.200
full hearts, everyone thinks
we're going to lose.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.801
But guess what.
We're not going to lose

00:06:17.801 --> 00:06:19.400
by as much as everyone thought

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.634
and we're going to call
that a win.

00:06:21.634 --> 00:06:23.000
Go get 'em."

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.534
Former President Trump's
daughter Tiffany is reportedly

00:06:26.534 --> 00:06:28.734
worried that Tropical Storm
Nicole will ruin

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:30.534
her wedding this weekend
at Mar-a-Lago.

00:06:30.534 --> 00:06:31.734
Though if I were her,

00:06:31.734 --> 00:06:34.300
I'd be more worried about
this tropical depression.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:37.367
[ Laughter ]
Just moping around, complaining

00:06:37.367 --> 00:06:40.701
about the midterms, jumping in
front to catch the bouquet,

00:06:40.701 --> 00:06:43.934
and yelling, "This means
I'm the nominee in 2024."

00:06:43.934 --> 00:06:46.200
[ Laughter ]

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.767
Allies of former President Trump
are reportedly telling him

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:51.834
to delay his planned 2024
campaign announcement,

00:06:51.834 --> 00:06:54.734
so now he has to come up with
a new explanation

00:06:54.734 --> 00:06:56.567
for what his big announcement
was.

00:06:56.567 --> 00:07:00.067
"Uh, we're launching Trump brand
hard seltzer."

00:07:00.067 --> 00:07:01.334
[ Laughter ]

00:07:01.334 --> 00:07:02.501
"That was always the plan

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:06.400
and not something
we just threw together."

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:10.467
Pennsylvania Republican Senate
candidate Dr. Mehmet Oz conceded

00:07:10.467 --> 00:07:11.734
yesterday in a phone call

00:07:11.734 --> 00:07:13.234
to Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman.

00:07:13.234 --> 00:07:14.534
Fetterman knew it was him

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:17.067
because it was not
a Pennsylvania number.

00:07:17.067 --> 00:07:21.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.834
Ex-Trump organization CFO Allen
Weisselberg recently testified

00:07:24.834 --> 00:07:27.467
that former President Trump
inflated the value of

00:07:27.467 --> 00:07:29.868
his Trump Tower apartment
by $200 million,

00:07:29.868 --> 00:07:33.100
which he did by claiming
it was a two-bedroom.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:37.434
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.767
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.767 --> 00:07:44.067
It's a joke about New York City
real estate, but...

00:07:44.067 --> 00:07:45.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:45.834 --> 00:07:47.300
I'll explain
during the commercial.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:52.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:52.801 --> 00:07:56.467
A T-Rex dinosaur skull will go
up for auction next month and is

00:07:56.467 --> 00:07:59.801
expected to sell for 20 million
of Nic Cage's dollars.

00:07:59.801 --> 00:08:03.200
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.133
A professional archer in Denmark
recently broke a Guinness

00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:08.734
world record by shooting
seven arrows through a keyhole.

00:08:08.734 --> 00:08:11.367
Great for him, terrible for
his nosy neighbor.

00:08:11.367 --> 00:08:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.834 --> 00:08:18.100
Is that a two-bedroom?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.067
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:26.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:26.234 --> 00:08:27.367
Phew.

00:08:27.367 --> 00:08:30.100
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:33.501
And finally, organizers of the
Westminster Kennel Club Dog Show

00:08:33.501 --> 00:08:36.000
have announced that next year's
event will be moved

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.334
from Madison Square Garden

00:08:37.334 --> 00:08:40.133
to Billie Jean King National
Tennis Center in Queens.

00:08:40.133 --> 00:08:42.067
What could possibly go wrong?

00:08:42.067 --> 00:08:44.200
[ Laughter ]

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.067
That was a monologue, everybody.

00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:49.968
♪♪

